<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan July wholesale prices up 11.18 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan July wholesale prices up 11.18 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index rose 11.18 percent in July year-on-year, compared with a 12.73 percent rise in July 1995, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The index rose 1.34 percent to 381.68 points in July after increasing 0.89 percent to 376.64 in June and 0.49 percent to 343.31 in July 1995.</p>
<p> PAKISTAN WHOLESALE PRICES     July	June     July 1995</p>
<p>    Index (1980/81=100)	 381.68    376.64     343.31</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (pct)	 +1.34     +0.89	+0.49</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	 +11.18    +10.24     +12.73</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
